WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.138
Nooooooooooo!

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:07.841
Oh, that's going to leave a mark!

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.409
So what should I have done?

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:11.811
Encrypt, wipe, destroy.

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:13.346
Then recycle.

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.447
Number one, encrypt.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:18.785
That way, if the bad guy gets a hold of
your drive, they can't read what's on it.

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.721
Number two,
wipe all the data on the drive.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:25.225
Use the operating system
to erase securely.

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.727
Number three, destroy the drive.

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.395
You could do it a lot of different ways.

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:33.266
Number four, take it to your local
electronics recycling center so it doesn't

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:34.167
end up in the landfill.

